"pointer":31187,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中独坐翏翏亭看桂花得张子崧书问兼怀孟阳 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"虽无千树小山丛，爱著繁花水榭东。\n十日花时连日雨，眼看狼藉欲随风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31188,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中独坐翏翏亭看桂花得张子崧书问兼怀孟阳 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"门外泥深客到稀，花开不肯待晴曦。\n烟笼雾锁疑增态，况复香风不断吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31189,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中独坐翏翏亭看桂花得张子崧书问兼怀孟阳 其三","author":"李流芳","text":"张家亭子玉山隈，毬子花开锦作堆。\n试问摧残缘底事，风吹雨打未为灾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31190,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中独坐翏翏亭看桂花得张子崧书问兼怀孟阳 其四","author":"李流芳","text":"故人万里不归家，我亦三年不见花。\n带雨独看应有意，欲题高兴寄天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31191,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月十九日雨后风气萧爽闻宗晓自山阴来将访之吴山下呼兜舆自钱王祠入清波门下上吴山历十庙而下遥见江光如银在冶江上越山翠色欲滴还登瑞石穿紫阳绕云居则湖光如匹练来扑人眼率尔口占","author":"李流芳","text":"湖白江红一望间，江山晚翠胜湖山。\n兜舆便作江湖主，买得山头亦等閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31192,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"白堤凉雨打荷花，妾未回船郎到家。\n郎醉不如侬醉剧，怜侬湿透绛裙纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31193,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"阁上弹琴江上听，松风江月若为情。\n酒阑重向溪桥坐，怪鸟惊啼虎欲行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31194,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其三","author":"李流芳","text":"风入溪流月在桥，低回难负此良宵。\n楼头梦醒江声发，唤起开门看夜潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31195,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其四","author":"李流芳","text":"相期百遍总能过，一日愆期可奈何。\n妾自寻郎郎不见，段家桥外画船多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31196,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其五","author":"李流芳","text":"郎意匆匆妾意长，赠郎微物亦思量。\n金花梨子能消渴，怕道生离不敢将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31197,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画送郑彦逸之西湖","author":"李流芳","text":"湖光只在断桥头，雨髻烟鬟一望收。\n我是当年旧游客，试凭杨柳说风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31198,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖邂逅山阴俞不仝连日欢饮席上口占 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"九年不见此髯公，十日西湖九日同。\n待缩九年为九日，君归何事苦匆匆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31199,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖邂逅山阴俞不仝连日欢饮席上口占 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"轻寒微霭养花天，十里桃堤似锦缠。\n花事未阑君且住，酒船今在六桥边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31200,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖邂逅山阴俞不仝连日欢饮席上口占 其三","author":"李流芳","text":"百年节序喜清明，不负花时有几人。\n杂板新腔歌百遍，深杯腊酒饮千巡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31201,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖邂逅山阴俞不仝连日欢饮席上口占 其四","author":"李流芳","text":"千岩万壑不曾看，一水悠悠欲渡难。\n与子相期仍未定，不如且尽眼前欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31202,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲子元日试笔作画兼题二绝句示家弟无垢是岁予五十将携家至武林有别业在皋亭桃花坞中山水佳处也 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"买得桃花一坞深，清泉白石久盟心。\n今朝便是知非日，一往仙源何处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31203,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲子元日试笔作画兼题二绝句示家弟无垢是岁予五十将携家至武林有别业在皋亭桃花坞中山水佳处也 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"黄村桥头树色深，遥怜入竹向山心。\n能添草阁山腰里，李径桃蹊不用寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31204,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为孙山人题画","author":"李流芳","text":"每爱疏林平远山，倪迂笔墨落人间。\n幽人近卜城南住，写出春风水一湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31205,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阊门即事","author":"李流芳","text":"江上凉风已似秋，客中歌吹亦生愁。\n金阊门外冶游子，灯火回船不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31206,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"李流芳","text":"虞山红树昔游时，每到秋冬入梦思。\n今日巴城又同棹，画中霜气最先知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31207,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画送平仲","author":"李流芳","text":"老去诗肠唤不应，分无丽句壮君行。\n江头日日黄梅雨，为写烟波柳外城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31208,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有僧欲礼清凉而未决来索予诗戏书四绝句 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"楖栗横肩衲挂身，芒鞋踏遍万山云。\n若逢婆子山前问，蓦直从来不误君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31209,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有僧欲礼清凉而未决来索予诗戏书四绝句 其二","author":"李流芳","text":"闻道边风最苦寒，风头起处欲行难。\n中台积雪深无路，处处封门不出看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31210,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有僧欲礼清凉而未决来索予诗戏书四绝句 其三","author":"李流芳","text":"我昔曾参老夜台，冰寒铁瘦石生苔。\n舍身入海闻还出，君到清凉试问来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31211,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有僧欲礼清凉而未决来索予诗戏书四绝句 其四","author":"李流芳","text":"文殊何必住清凉，大地何曾不放光。\n自是凡夫心执著，登山涉水费资粮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31212,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐陵如朱尔凝北上 其一","author":"李流芳","text":"黄河木落见征帆，莫道风寒去路难。\n一曲琵琶刁酒辣，西山迎马雪中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31213,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]